"""Website chat: how long dental work lasts, how durable each material is, and how to make it last.

General patient information, not a promise: every answer is followed by a note that the dentist confirms
what to expect for the patient's own teeth. Clinic-specific points come from Dental Haven's 2026 price list
(3D-printed veneers may discolor in about 3-5 years; direct composite veneers are recalled every 2-3 years;
crowns and bridges are made in 1-2 weeks, so a temporary crown is worn that long).

LIFE: answers for one treatment/material. `kw` is a list of alternatives; each alternative is a list of words
that must all appear in the question. The most specific (longest) matching alternative wins.
TOPICS: general questions (what affects lifespan, signs of trouble, strongest materials...). `about`, when set,
means the question must also mention dental work (a crown, denture, material...).
"""
